Computer fisso (desktop/torre) ::: Desktop computer (desktop/tower) ::: Ordenador de sobremesa (desktop/torre) ::: Ordinateur fixe (bureau/tour) ::: Desktop-Computer (Desktop/Tower)
Portatile (notebook) ::: Laptop (notebook) ::: Portátil (notebook) ::: Portable (notebook) ::: Laptop (Notebook)
